Example:

IF:

attendance_percentage < 75%

THEN:

create academic support task.

Another example:

IF:

fee_due_days > 15

THEN:

send parent reminder.

Another:

IF:

vehicle_document_expiry <= 30 days

THEN:

create transport admin task.

